# AI-assistant working files: useful locally, not part of the published SDK.
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md
.planning/
# Beads issue tracker: local-only by decision. The database, the config, the
# hooks and the agent-instruction blocks all stay out of the public remote —
# bd init's own hooks embed an absolute path from whichever machine ran it,
# which is portable to nobody. Mirror it privately if the team needs it shared.
.beads/
.dolt/
.beads-credential-key

